{%- comment -%}
  Today and tomorrow side by side; tomorrow and the day after in the evening (`start`).
  Sets `pair` and `two`: full.liquid then draws them with partials/two_days (once in the
  file, for this view and the weekend, so the markup stays under TRMNL's 100 kB).
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- assign pair = "" -%}
{%- for d in days offset: start limit: 2 -%}{%- assign pair = pair | append: d | append: "," -%}{%- endfor -%}
{%- assign pair = pair | split: "," -%}
{%- assign weekend = false -%}{%- assign two = true -%}
